# Slack channel adapter
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN: https://api.slack.com/apps → your app → OAuth & Permissions.
#   After installing to your workspace, copy the "Bot User OAuth Token"
#   (starts with xoxb-). Used as Authorization: Bearer <token>.
SLACK_BOT_TOKEN=

# SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET: same app → Basic Information → App Credentials →
#   Signing Secret. Used to verify HMAC-SHA256 (v0 scheme) on every inbound
#   Events API POST. Required — Slack will mark your endpoint failing if
#   verification doesn't succeed.
SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET=

# After deploy, set Event Subscriptions → Request URL in the Slack dashboard:
#   <your-https-url>/channels/slack
# Slack POSTs once with type=url_verification + a `challenge` field; the
# server should respond with HTTP 200 and the challenge value as plain text.
# Subscribe to bot events: message.channels, message.im, app_mention.
